Z||000000||Dan010||10-31-2001||08:04 PM||||When first cold start, is it in open loop?<BR>What does it use to cal. when it is to go to closed loop, MAT and/or coolant temperature sensor, or.....?<BR>How long does it run in open loop before going to closed loop, generally?<BR>Should there be a drop in RPM when the occures?<BR>Thanks||||reg||1
Z||000001||Joe Torma||10-31-2001||08:16 PM||||Time, coolant temp and O2 sensor readings.<BR>Yes...the engine will idle down, as it finished warming up.<P>Interesting note...my brother has a 305 Camaro with lots of mods(hedders, cam,etc).  It would go in and out of closed loop and run like cr@p.  I found on the Camaro forum that they have to install heated O2 sensors(like new cars have) because the exhaust temp would drop enough to put it back into open loop!  No problems now.||||reg||1
